<title>JAPAN: Sakura Rubber - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sakura Rubber - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.53		vs	    2.88</p>
<p> Operating	  150    million	  vs	  105    million</p>
<p> Current	     95    million	  vs	   19    million</p>
<p> Net		   51    million	  vs	    9    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.08 yen	  vs	    0.94 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sakura Rubber Co Ltd specialises in the manufacturing of rubber hoses, aircraft parts and other industrial products.</p>
</text>
